Commit:     Dan Davison <dandavison7@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Mon Jul 1 04:35:47 2019 -0400

    Support --width=variable
    
    This option means that background diff highlighting should extend to
    the end of each line, without right padding lines to produce equal
    width.


